# Rt56 2026-10-09 (events/r56_GXC_events.txt): `CHI_li_zongren` is a character,
# written as a bare scope in GXC_event.14's country trigger. The game evaluates
# the trigger for every country, so each country without the character logs an
# invalid-scope error every tick. Rescope the check to the owning country.
country_event[id = GXC_event.14]:
  trigger:
    -CHI_li_zongren:
    +CHI:
      CHI_li_zongren:
        is_hired_as_advisor(yes)
